            <ArticleTitle>Rib pain in a 23-year-old woman with severe asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This case illustrates the importance of considering a wide range of diagnoses in patients complaining of rib, flank, and pleuritic pain. Further, additional evaluation is warranted when &quot;pneumonia&quot; does not respond to conventional treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
